{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0415","name":"申不害","evidence":["wudi-q-o202"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o202-wudi-p0415","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o202"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-o202","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1ecf403c81eacebd9775","layer":"original","quote":"评曰〖1〗：汉末天下大乱，雄豪并起。而袁绍虎视四州〖2〗，强盛莫敌。太祖运筹演谋，鞭挞宇内〖3〗：揽申、商之法术〖4〗，该韩、白之奇策〖5〗；官方授材〖6〗，各因其器；矫情任算，不念旧恶。终能总御皇机〖7〗，克成洪业者，惟其明略最优也〖8〗。抑可谓非常之人〖9〗，超世之杰矣！","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":462,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
